ids":["c-shiji-039-jin","c-shiji-040-chu"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p003","quote":"唐叔子燮，是爲晉侯。晉侯子寧族，是爲武侯。武侯之子服人，是爲成侯。成侯子福，是爲厲侯。厲侯之子宜臼，是爲靖侯。靖侯已來，年紀可推。自唐叔至靖侯五世，無其年數。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p003","quote":"周文王之時，季連之苗裔曰鬻熊。鬻熊子事文王，蚤卒。其子曰熊麗。熊麗生熊狂，熊狂生熊繹。熊繹當周成王之時，舉文、武勤勞之後嗣，而封熊繹於楚蠻，封以子男之田，姓羋氏，居丹陽。楚子熊繹與魯公伯禽、衞康叔子牟、晉侯燮、齊太公子呂伋倶事成王。"}],"rationale":"楚篇晉侯燮與晉篇唐叔子燮是為晉侯的封國與名號比較，限此祖系段落。 未由同名泛推全庫、也未用此段校定共同任職年代。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p003","text":"唐叔子燮，是爲晉侯。晉侯子寧族，是爲武侯。武侯之子服人，是爲成侯。成侯子福，是爲厲侯。厲侯之子宜臼，是爲靖侯。靖侯已來，年紀可推。自唐叔至靖侯五世，無其年數。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m003-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"唐叔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000193","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m003-0003","start":3,"end":4,"surface":"燮","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001685","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m003-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"晉侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001685","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m003-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"晉侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001685","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m003-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"寧族","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001686","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m003-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"武侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001686","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m003-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"武侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001686","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m003-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"服人","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001687","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m003-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"成侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p0